    <briefdescription>
<para>Caller-asserted runtime envelope compared field-by-field to a <computeroutput><ref refid="classxverse_1_1xcom_1_1validation_1_1Permit" kindref="compound">Permit</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The consumption path compares each field to the bound permit and reports the first mismatch with its <computeroutput>FieldLocator</computeroutput>. A <computeroutput><ref refid="structxverse_1_1xcom_1_1validation_1_1SessionContext" kindref="compound">SessionContext</ref></computeroutput> is a plain value; it is copied into the comparison and never retained by the manager. <simplesect kind="par"><title>Unit specification: T025-U-SESSION</title><para></para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
